ntent.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 17, 2020, 6:35 PM UTC (b697c42)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5838/history.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 17, 2020, 6:35 PM UTC (b697c42)\">/history.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5838/3729254...b697c42/history.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 17, 2020, 6:35 PM UTC (b697c42)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5838/iframe-embed-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 17, 2020, 6:35 PM UTC (b697c42)\">/iframe-embed-object.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5838/3729254...b697c42/iframe-embed-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 17, 2020, 6:35 PM UTC (b697c42)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5838/imagebitmap-and-animations.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 17, 2020, 6:35 PM UTC (b697c42)\">/imagebitmap-and-animations.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5838/3729254...b697c42/imagebitmap-and-animations.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 17, 2020, 6:35 PM UTC (b697c42)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5838/input.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 17, 2020, 6:35 PM UTC (b697c42)\">/input.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5838/3729254...b697c42/input.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 17, 2020, 6:35 PM UTC (b697c42)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5838/interactive-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 17, 2020, 6:35 PM UTC (b697c42)\">/interactive-elements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5838/3729254...b697c42/interactive-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 17, 2020, 6:35 PM UTC (b697c42)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5838/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 17, 2020, 6:35 PM UTC (b697c42)\">/links.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5838/3729254...b697c42/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 17, 2020, 6:35 PM UTC (b697c42)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5838/media.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 17, 2020, 6:35 